{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07656","headline":"行路难五首 一 · 贺兰进明","name":"行路难五首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"君不见岩下井，百尺不及泉。\n君不见山上苗，数寸凌云烟。\n人生赋命亦如此，何苦太息自忧煎。\n但愿亲友长含笑，相逢不乏杖头钱。\n寒夜邀欢须秉烛，岂得常思花柳年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贺兰进明","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07656.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07656","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}